'''Robert I Baratheon''' is the king of the [[Seven Kingdoms]]. He dies after a hunt.
==History==
Robert led [[Robert's Rebellion]] in [[282 AC]] and was crowned in [[283 AC]] at [[King's Landing]]. He was fostered with [[Eddard Stark]] at the [[Eyrie]].
==Recent Events==
===A Game of Thrones===
Robert rides to [[Winterfell]] to name [[Eddard Stark]] his Hand. He is gored by a boar and dies.
